---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Container from '../components/ui/Container.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/ui/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'November 21, 2026';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Hossain Growth collects, uses, and protects your information."
  noindex={false}
>
  <section class="bg-ink-950 py-16 text-bone-50 lg:py-20">
    <Container class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <Breadcrumbs
        items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]}
        class="text-ink-400"
      />
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-ink-300">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20">
    <Container class="prose-content text-ink-800">
      <p>
        Hossain Growth ("we", "us", or "our") respects your privacy. This policy explains what
        information we collect through hossaingrowth.com, how we use it, and the choices you have.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>When you use our website or contact us, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Information you provide directly, such as your name, email address, phone number, company,
          and the contents of any message submitted through our contact form.
        </li>
        <li>
          Technical information collected automatically, such as IP address, browser type, and
          general usage data, used for security and site performance.
        </li>
        <li>
          Verification data from Cloudflare Turnstile, used to confirm that form submissions come
          from a human rather than automated software.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to inquiries submitted through our contact form.</li>
        <li>To provide, maintain, and improve our services and website.</li>
        <li>To protect our website against spam, abuse, and fraudulent submissions.</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations where applicable.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>How we store and protect your information</h2>
      <p>
        Our website and the information submitted through it are hosted on Cloudflare's
        infrastructure. We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect
        information from unauthorized access, including encrypted connections and access controls on
        our internal systems.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        We use essential cookies required for our website and admin systems to function securely,
        such as session cookies used to keep you signed in to authorized areas of the site. We do
        not use third-party advertising cookies on hossaingrowth.com.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        We use Cloudflare for hosting, security, and bot protection (Turnstile). These providers
        process data on our behalf under their own privacy and security commitments.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain contact and lead information for as long as necessary to respond to your inquiry
        and maintain our business records, after which it may be securely deleted or anonymized.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your location, you may have the right to request access to, correction of, or
        deletion of your personal information. To make such a request, contact us using the details
        below.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our website is intended for business audiences and is not directed at children under 16.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date above reflects the most
        recent changes.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this policy or how your information is handled, contact us
        through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </Container>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
